<p>Once again, try various hand shift locations.</p>
<p><img class=3D"alignnone size-full wp-image-1237" src=3D"https://www.guit=
arlessonworld.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/12/6thstringdescendingexercise.gi=
f" alt=3D"6th String Notes Descending" width=3D"865" height=3D"238"></p>
