</span>
</footer>
<div class=3D"mh-comment-content">
<p>A visual tool like that may be helpful to some at first, but you shouldn=
=E2=80=99t make it permanent (in my opinion). At some point, you need to ha=
ve instant recall without the labels. It=E2=80=99s like using your fingers =
to do math. It can help, but you want to do the math in your head for the f=
astest results.</p>
</div>
